# Play test of Utopia Remade (CIPlay utopia_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the quay on the
# north beach (1.8 m) and its pier, the prison house's flats (6 m) with the clerk's desk in front, the path up to the
# warden's yard on the summit (18 m), its gate in the north side.
# Quest "The Warden's Gate", 20 steps: the docks (1-9), the prison house (10-14), the summit (15-20).
island Utopia Remade
offset 2.5752 -7.9918
expect step 0
expect title The Warden's Gate

# The docks: Olof's last message on the covered crate, his crate, the empty cage, the fisherman's crate, the market's
# stores, the trader's stack box (six pages)
walk 8 52 to 6 46 h=1.8
zone docks
expect step 1
read Olof's last message
expect step 2
open Olof's crate
expect step 3
open Empty cage
expect step 4
open Fisherman's crate
expect step 5
open Market stores
expect step 6
open Trader's stack box
wait 2
expect step 7

# The dock master's crate at the end of the pier
walk 6 47 to 6 51 to 8.6 55.8 h=1.8
reach Dock master's crate
open Dock master's crate
expect story dockkey 1
wait 2
expect step 9

# The prison clerk's desk in front of the prison house - its rats first; the crate beside it, nine pages
walk 14 44 to 19 36 to 22 31 h=6
zone clerkyard
expect step 10
kill Rat
expect step 11
walk 20.5 31.5 to 22 30.1 h=6
reach Prison clerk's desk
open Prison clerk's desk
expect story prisonkey 1
wait 2
expect step 13
open Clerk's crate
wait 2
expect step 14

# RAFT REMADE 10-26: Olof's crew camp and their journal, Lighthouse Head and the gate's third key, the secrets
zone crewcamp
expect step 15
read Crew's journal
expect step 16
zone headfoot
zone lighthouse
expect step 17
open Keeper's box
expect story keeperkey 1
expect step 19
use Crew token 1
use Crew token 2
use Crew token 3
use Crew token 4
use Crew token 5
use Crew token 6
wait 1
expect message All six crew tokens
expect item TitaniumIngot 2
zone quarrycave
open Quarrymen's strongbox
open Warden's plane crate
open Cargo yard crate
zone jump_ut_finale
open Guards' tin

# Up the path to the summit: the warden's gate shut until both keys turn in it
walk 4 41 to 1.9 33.8 to -0.2 26.6 to -2.3 19.4 to -4.4 12.2 to -6.5 5 to -6.5 3 h=18
walk -6.5 2.6 to -6.5 -1 blocked h=18
use wardensgate
expect message All three keys turn
expect story dockkey 0
expect story prisonkey 0
expect story keeperkey 0
wait 3
walk -6.5 3 to -6.5 -1 to -6.5 -3.5 h=18
zone yard
expect step 20
kill Hyena
expect step 21

# The warden's table, his pot, his jar (twelve pages) - and his chest behind the table
open Warden's table
expect step 22
open Warden's pot
expect step 24
# the twelve pages are already found by now (the pages step completes with the pot), so the jar adds no step
open Warden's jar
wait 5
expect step 24
walk -2.5 -5 to -2.5 -11.8 to -4.8 -12.3 h=18
reach Warden's chest
open Warden's chest
wait 4
expect item Blueprint_TitaniumTools 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric 1
wait 2
expect done
